---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ExternalLink from '../components/ExternalLink.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="TypeMIN을 소개합니다. 포트폴리오와 웹앱 프로젝트를 만나보세요.">
  <section class="page-intro" aria-labelledby="about-title"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h1 id="about-title">About<span class="brand-dot">.</span></h1><p>안녕하세요, TypeMIN입니다.</p></section>
  <section class="about-page" aria-labelledby="about-name"><div class="about-identity"><span class="about-monogram" aria-hidden="true">t.</span><h2 id="about-name">{site.name}</h2><ExternalLink href={site.githubUrl}>GitHub</ExternalLink></div><div class="about-page-copy"><p>{site.about}</p><p>완성된 프로젝트의 배경과 과정은 포트폴리오에, 직접 사용해 볼 수 있는 앱은 Webapp Projects에 모읍니다.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="/portfolio/" class="button">포트폴리오 보기 <Arrow /></a><a href="/webapp-projects/" class="text-link">웹앱 둘러보기 <Arrow /></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
